    "description": {
      "value": "<p>\"Hang on, guys? Is the hair on the back of your neck tingling?\"</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Assassin techniques class feature, intuition as a chosen assassin specialization, know at least 3 intuition techniques</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you do not get to act in a surprise round, you may assign 1 presence to up to two creatures in combat with a presence pool.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
